    "model": {
      "chapter": "A constituted GUDECA chapter. It has a register of its own and takes names. A chapter is NOT a city — see the correction below.",
      "location": "A country or city where Guneku people live. It may sit under a chapter (`partOf`), or under none.",
      "place": "Free text for where a body actually sits. For a chapter that moves, it says so rather than naming a city."
    },
    "corrections": [
      "2026-09-03 — GUDECA EU is a EUROPE-WIDE chapter, not a German or a Bonn chapter. Meetings rotate across Europe. Bonn is the official residence of H.R.H. the Fon; the 28 March 2026 meeting simply happened to be held there. Earlier revisions of this file and of /diaspora and /gudeca pinned the chapter first to Essen and then to Bonn. Both were wrong for the same reason: a chapter was being stored as a city. Chapters and locations are now separate kinds, and a chapter carries `place`, not a city.",
      "2026-09-03 — Thadeus Fon, General President of GUDECA, is home-based and belongs to the Douala chapter, not to any diaspora chapter."
    ]
  },
